{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1281,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1829e5ca5feaf8bebc2100b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迷路的新生…米浴去打招呼的话，\n会不会添麻烦呢…？\n但是…但，但是但是…",
      "source_fingerprint": "51e6f098f72a3baf3f4b9ca8d562392cd7c8d833a877410dca7eb1f6106441da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fa55eb49c42d924d09b3119",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要是不会下阵雨就好了…\n哥哥会淋湿什么的，\n不行不行…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7e10a1b912d37a8a62399da8083ea971c8786416427ae3090b829cb23c5735a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23d2e9705cd21ab41a933050",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "落叶做成的床，就像绘本上\n描述的那样很松软吧…！\n米浴也想试试看呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51e9032eaede08d1c3833f67f90db0da1da7afdcab9dceb4bf11d1e74080b1c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9fcd30b34859983c704c25c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…不，不能靠近！\n静电会啪叽啪叽的…对不起呢。\n虽然会寂寞但是要忍耐才行…",
      "source_fingerprint": "17116c2bab22a6931e7b70bb5673ca1730761551e885add5398cf4652407640d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc2e2c0106919db79d5727d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟荒漠英雄同学在房间里\r\n一起施了魔法。\r\n让明天也变成美好的一天…那种！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f33426aa768f0815caaf4803d39c589e283a893966f4d7073c3d9fb8b828a9ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fc14cf82060bbc43ba7744a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "波旁同学用很快的速度\r\n做了南瓜灯……！吓了我一跳呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34e79a8c01ed436e163cd75119d8e13bc4f7da473a698ecb0e0d202cf46d9332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f34729d48da44c3aee53344",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸血鬼不能吃大蒜吐司呢……\r\n唔，现在我得忍耐一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da48bf56ca20f4a13d5003eb8f742302db61980ed33bff512943698d035d23a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:369934d69425e4fa9cb5f596",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥、哥哥！\r\n不给糖果的话，就、就、就…\r\n呜呜…不捣蛋不行吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9664400724e97229f2bae9e6717921e82b5b738603585e4e9c04e0571f42ec9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fbddccbed97a5e537849fd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到南瓜，\r\n作为魔法使的马车很有名呢……！\r\n要是哪天米浴也能坐坐就好了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f6fca1b5f2290709a7df284087eb62beac4e82074966ca721d38d3f08e64aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f63f4da46f4542bc8aead91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做了个奇怪的梦……\r\n梦到了饿着肚子的吸血鬼……\r\n是米浴的不幸体质造成的吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "05360bac2c2230bb989c62dacfd9fd870b0b7ee9b634fd10a6954b11d63ccf85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9097b8e2cf008f2874039a6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在学园里走着的时候，\r\n大家给了我点心……\r\n给了这么多，要怎么办呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0beaa7b164c03d45068fad5e09c3c9f2e038712822ad1320e00d5a949f3c3ad1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93500066038913e094e269d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈在睡前给我读过的绘本\r\n『小妖怪的幸福家庭』……\r\n真想和哥哥一起读一读啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dd9751516cf3a67bf1dcb7d1b1eea3515fe4c283d8055cedeadfc97a7fdcaf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c9b06edf020fbf110f3d38d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸血鬼不能在明亮的地方\r\n看绽放的花吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "74c7cd8b70a31b3f37c3d56c294f76c8227abc6eb3afb3c8153cdfc92cd3e774",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b25f9eda0aa400c3567f7c57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "盂兰盆舞中真的会有妖怪先生\r\n混进来吗……？说不定还会\r\n来参加胜者Live……呜欸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69020df73a18f2a1f665b421e374a345050f0ca89cc181ea4b852b4450bfcd28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ac9e2c7031d595916441f5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节的准备，\r\n从装饰到点心都是大家一起做的。\r\n米浴有稍微帮到忙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0f88a716219df3bf3db5de22a71f617814afa9aee402bc1b015385bc5ea884d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee2360c64deef79436e5b643",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "屋檐下的冰柱看起来很像牙齿……\r\n和米浴的一样呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "60bd2e95e190d9d0d8604de0a1508805fc0c6e4f1bcf8ad824f396099e81fb44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bc0e2092a4c63294c9e9dde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是能用背上的翅膀飞起来就好了。\r\n……希望，中途不要掉下去……",
      "source_fingerprint": "84f7754e81072ecf145110b4049cec7177c93654843d3ccb92b98df5ee0e926b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c6b8e81d81d57b918cc7c15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "其实，米浴嘴里还装有牙齿哦。\r\n咿——……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0cf7c04f6364db3f340b05489a0f92b45c400c5fee7d286573d2091bbd87243",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b33d5917f0c38b468a04b59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要是不会下阵雨就好了…\n姐姐会淋湿什么的，\n不行不行…！…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6fd2fe1fcae2716480fc668d4835de03e38d85d28438928ea55b685d4416a1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06cc3fa4242acb5c851c35de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐、姐姐！\r\n不给糖果的话，就、就、就…\r\n呜呜…不捣蛋不行吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dba6d59ca97e5db7844a84b67138e1a1f12535f2de26f2607397e516ede67552",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5b10b1058b46f9389588be2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "妈妈在睡前给我读过的绘本\r\n『小妖怪的幸福家庭』……\r\n真想和姐姐一起读一读啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d119a956ccd7cdd89ee168b63ba3f35f32585f6c3b1cf10382035d8cec578158",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b593ce451283b7659b5113ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "波旁同学说想要一个\r\n绝对不会坏的电饭煲……\r\n钻……钻石做的怎么样……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdaddcdcde97342177a51d96c9595ab25353d48738240a5df0cb4f803dc557c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd11b296bb3331b36873c192",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳神同学的『派对咖饭』\r\n好棒啊……！味道很好，彩虹色的\r\n很漂亮……米浴也想试着做一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a64eb77b52308cdc18bc6ef06f854a3cb46ecbdbfd938f616c2baa8a6be4eb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec4e9618409129c6d089fc1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做料理时的大进同学……\r\n眼神很温柔呢。是像米浴一样\r\n给最喜欢的人做的吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed40288d66e3bd707765000349ecc7378f579f6ee19c6842b027fc480dfcad40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f22aed0c58aa5dbc327669e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光明同学……\r\n是把米浴当成人偶了吗？\r\n她很喜欢紧紧地抱住我……啊呜",
      "source_fingerprint": "fce98452daeae74753b573bc11ccb8180ca2c6edce5c85ca186d3edc53d34ffb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5684f5fae34ec4b445d75b68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真想变得像王牌同学一样\r\n可靠啊……！『交给我吧！』\r\n米浴也想说出这样的话……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0144c091112e72bc7cd2ea4cac970d55afb499a098acff1f840704c5b2c866f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:021ca1d59e7f94ad8302ba9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还很困吗……？\r\n可以的话，我来泡早餐咖啡吧。\r\n就算是米浴……也能做到……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ab25168293bd3e9a4c7331dcfbced01cb9ce3bb22df62143be74b2de5923fe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fba31e9cc0574a3c4dfd65f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "餐厅的工作人员……真厉害啊，\r\n为大家准备了那么多午饭……\r\n好帅气……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a34c20ad0ef0b4ba86fec6a943cfade793a5e44b0b1e4a9a71e865522a99a14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24057fca372ee7732ed226c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "狄杜斯同学教了我拉伸动作，\r\n今晚来试试看吧……♪\r\n要是能缓解身体僵硬就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53cf6d757a20bc4a233b4580df931bf9df21bfe18870218bef8b99e3e628d9d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51f9a0881182aedba8d10919",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和小乌拉拉一起做的樱花冰沙……\r\n下次给哥哥也带些来吧。\r\n米浴带来的，春天的馈赠……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "954bb107c2b04c05c6be42ba8bea8650289df648831909eee6f622a02bdf013b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72d330f2c291fc0bd7835113",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜欸欸……挂面又煮到溢出来了……\r\n哥哥，可以教米浴怎么煮面吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b953ea1b053cb027c633457bc02a3aa60637c5d703c3fb8e9ffee92443a6039",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b8b10a5c561f6ff454e8553",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥的手……和红叶很像。\r\n很漂亮，看着就让人\r\n心里暖洋洋的……对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "45c84fc6d449eff33ae9949ba0c4f6ae546babe71c15a16734a6c8473c67e49f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71fa19ae0dacefb48b0bd78d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜~……下雪天果然很冷啊……\r\n得多穿一点，\r\n变成暖呼呼的米浴才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d092016eab8fe691ad7362ba5836d6047d8f00f2cd3b20cd028b9544026ce439",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8bdf467f75d332f6b58fc55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "系着围裙的话，就能干劲十足……\r\n这大概也是米浴的……决胜服吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "86acb81aa3f9aa7410641f214b3b8e2f1cfd7d832248ad01e0d8a573bae8b2cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc5077be40075c5b4530c9cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蔬菜和水果……大家大家都很可爱呢♪\r\n就是看久了肚子会饿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56ae1a47b0923a1dc15974d380a4da054e395be27cbea3aa86a237fe00f730e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ce22e296a881b45aedb2b4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和小乌拉拉一起做的樱花冰沙……\n下次给姐姐也带些来吧。\n米浴带来的，春天的馈赠……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cf98f966d2f57ccfa50c75700c5ef56e9887d785de0a52ad927279b013a30ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91324"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d246eb5c4c91477438fdac9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜欸欸……挂面又煮到溢出来了……\r\n姐姐，可以教米浴怎么煮面吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "81e0fcbaa3acd8c3734d060bd8b04b6679a3535367a9ca568c6a6818db02259a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91325"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c7df2f57064ae7b00739330",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐的手……和红叶很像。\r\n很漂亮，看着就让人\r\n心里暖洋洋的……对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "36a334b9c320bca8b1626d4a030b746bf4e3a53f46b4b990697dec35bf274557",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "91326"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce63fcc079854092d4eaf807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，今天也，\n请多多指教…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83502928935bc3cafc35ccfcac3d3ba57176f1f061dc360673a46b977ccdc5c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c63b1215733e2fce74d9e63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，要上了",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e7850c14c3e3d7bdba5cb96dfefad427cb1b45e3a9328be3849489c0a3d619d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87128a00ce348f1932d967e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸～…呼～…\n…加油米浴，加油ー…\n哦ー…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2abc7295ae0f3de9006d5fe9df04648410173c18e2235d7305d086e479e9ed36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dab7ea55d31d1275a198114",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是什么训练，\n我都会努力的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb26dff85cfb78824d3244d081d009d80618bbb5571a83ee470c34d9544b36d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfd419f8b6ff8290c77c29cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴…有好好地\n进行成长吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f2d0485846adfa27eef4258c4faf5aeb850b66a92213c048d98ce461b36699c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a53af7a8b516b96cb9d84a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴可能还差的很远\n但…我会努力的。\n…我还想，变得更强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8326e345bc6f4a6d5b5f2820486e634adfad92a4c0b1775644917665eaccb96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ddc06d7ba6c17e745e72a32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近的跑步很快乐。\n诶嘿嘿…想再快一点啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "394338afbcf46a5418416614c98f99c697f78fe90c935419a6e06cbfea30d97f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30196cf4cbb3052a600d0bef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥，拜托了。\n再多来些训练吧。\n米浴…想获得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b6af22f65418a634833d62d0605122beec35661b035b9b7eeafb9ed6df42fc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5022c993a3b7fc48b088e8cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐，拜托了。\n再多来些训练吧。\n米浴…想获得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "165205fc7ad2da30e9c182741c9ad6b394285bb6adba2061a4a3b1b67fdcf84b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93b656da2850e5ac4cb38afa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿…，啊！\n对，对不起，不是笑的时候吧。\n因为很高兴，所以不知不觉就…",
      "source_fingerprint": "e33912d1e84d20f4f00199d33e48f5ac1b70022376e4efa52fc2ccabdbba2676",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc5204b49db2f5c7c200e24c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发箍戴好了，翅膀穿好了，\r\n蹄铁装好了，牙齿也戴上了……\r\n嗯！准备OK了哦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a60e4d74a592fd79c3d4c65566eb8ba2bea303341cee72088bdd99cc13002e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed6672ba6979b5e2b6a60d7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不让我训练的话就要恶作剧了……\r\n开、开玩笑的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dad142b8831fca9bbfba85d530b2ef555d2fb0cd548d0f4a5842d5ed70d59b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5037fbb318f38d593aa3ec36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定会比飞还要快的……！\r\n要加油喽——哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b28289408c5fa689a22eb995528bc35f1e170e596caca27b8592a520b4b17f9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c31ae13104207ddbcff0007",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Pum、Pum、Pumpkin♪\r\n南瓜小点心……\r\n啊！对对对、对不起！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c57112960a3d8944ddc33344877a216153db1ceaab57604311db3bad5e1fd9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb9c39174652c646a1ac63fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练结束后，想一起喝喝茶……\r\n我准备了很多点心呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9da2e644b23c543c4b7b3b68d84a1e75e7de1266dd541b6fcd436272432b8e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2ab0eb927c0621e44c1a99d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像越来越快了……！\r\n不管来什么样的妖怪，\r\n我都会牵着哥哥的手逃走的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4644aa728be7aed02fdbe307794d7bd2883b294017c0aa2a2be82c115190929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14d91bba82a67949615b7576",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥……即使米浴真的变成了吸血鬼，\r\n你也会和我在一起吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "01720ca20946cf23e1d1d73e71912d040d694ab7c08a287081eba00b18357d84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb5322a01d7d43512cbd1c42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像越来越快了……！\r\n不管来什么样的妖怪，\r\n我都会牵着姐姐的手逃走的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d86b328ff6b4cc0540f5761d67540db92a0303bb210abc3c8c9512505d78f3ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:057f705726b85d5d4b056135",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐……即使米浴真的变成了吸血鬼，\r\n你也会和我在一起吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b9d139b29a30db1e5abb398d76447b3d5d7e29b445e04c0f1d784be6c58cba4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d89753577ee8a7627eaca3e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多多吃饭，多多运动……\r\n然后变得更强更强……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "914796da6eed744adc80f07993cfd09e34f949ffa19051f24428305b8855cf29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b0d088541bb4406f07ed274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "精神满满，气势满满！\r\n米浴，今天也要好好加油……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bc745dd637f74067f02c783676d112d6c20bcedf767beba26999cb02e7f8f86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:033f61ca6c878deeae83e92e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "草莓、胡萝卜♪山椒、苦瓜♪\r\n就、就只是想说说看而已……\r\n欸嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e15f331a52847e77edbe3d82ef8663347cb33091882aa44d0f89197f8f0465af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c02d91fab544bbd0b1d7fe87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "腰带啾地勒好了。\r\n米浴也啾地有气势了。\r\n嗯，准备OK了哦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "444ad7caed9ad101596cab8acbf9649e6a0624a4e3bd2106c6abb84401bbc171",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e1361f0425ad4ea8adbcf6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不输给田里的蔬菜，\r\n米浴也会茁壮成长……！\r\n所以……今后也要看着米浴哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "abab27d06d4b84d37b0133150976e664799e2c7d493bb91752d8ba3e97dd4b38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49e7e12fdda66b227af57662",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哥哥努力的样子是米浴的\r\n精神源泉哦……！无论比赛\r\n还是料理……都有在后背支撑着我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2607ff756d5348b65c59a9c306aaa76007c2ea3635f05635b0037f2d8ed987f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba75cfe50ac684dd70de4c5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "培育了米浴……真的很感谢\r\n米浴一定会为哥哥献上\r\n让人目瞪口呆的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4f0783750018a9e37781034cdacc73e698c66d0002f2c4a334fcced2fe48d2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39b2a21258c9e0197708e6a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姐姐努力的样子是米浴的\r\n精神源泉哦……！无论比赛\r\n还是料理……都有在后背支撑着我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cae0bd6256bbcce544a5bfe32c79a55946bc6d81ab1dbc1954a625eca712bd77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92321"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20ac15896b47a1ec772443c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "培育了米浴……真的很感谢\r\n米浴一定会为姐姐献上\r\n让人目瞪口呆的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c71543e0c0f4d57bb41016ce1d3d54412c9dba5a9f77eb9831a939535d88252",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "92322"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:128ad7a48a316f72fd94260f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为有哥哥陪着，我才会站在这里…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6059ca3cafce450593ea9873e560006a3942507f3f3aab65a233da6cda4971cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f59234bb63bf63b175209bcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为有姐姐陪着，我才会站在这里…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3637d2d709d76a1b2eeb319a1ee848f8e665897106a0838a17c5464684803483",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2df3057e750a55ed9f282396",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴，接近想要成为的自己了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4edbfb6acfdf55b9aa5434326968c1c0b5b46a25f2851a1fce54f7dec7cee0de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca387525d9f9285b0974ccb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使活在永恒的时间里，\r\n也不会忘记的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92a9fe5218550e2af8a873431bb0bf83152793e21dc1000f685638bcc75f73f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09bc31bcab8c85d45f708a4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和平常不一样的米浴……\r\n感觉怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "75b60b405c900344e5bd06ffb627c0688768c0b902348a7411a11e2951989679",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae567987d314420ce2ca99a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴和大家做的特制料理……完成了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c1a44dd93051582b4fcf063994bb852e24c9a03e1468f06b4c1b1b0c0cf0078",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:affae28675124c5e7845a24d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都是多亏了哥哥的菜单哦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd2f4443dbcae11961c1133f25903b9cae71ac1fcc5f11fa3201c977da67495d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf26d7190f534fd2c9f7a6a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "都是多亏了姐姐的菜单哦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "73cd41d16223e247712841f2fcc300f8cc259e8c9c7f61fbe358356438fde806",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "93305"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15abd11681cc09582a43c462",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微，变强一点了吧…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2602a84a1efcbd2720eb398e737b28a6949feb577eab6388ab4d05cb19099be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8b00e9377c02fe1bb02e1dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果和哥哥一起的话，那么米浴也…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e3465810817e470feb63d7792d387288397a6b75631762ced4b8a63165484af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df3cf2cddde16d2d17e5a10b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀，呀…！是米浴哦…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e8cebca1fc955a3afbfce7f8b6cb47d79228916b0dd018e3a6050a249f42e32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:377788ee7fdc26983d861090",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为想让大家变得幸福…\n米浴，出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f50201cfa1eda5a6022bfcf86b46ba4e68825e812cc0f5801bfaab8f5764b0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87886ffdddd73aa4c0772a5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样就能派上用场了吧…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a919224bf31f3dcb23a4b72ad962b13e96563166bfd9fdabb2ebe69d48bc45da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a92365a1c1b941e9ede57b34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "米浴，会更帮上更多忙的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46160ca85db9d4e72ce16a79e2e3172ae1236975bb7cc0a3aabbaab1c25b03ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1030",
        "95006"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
